<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - USA Detergents cut.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - USA Detergents cut.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- PaineWebber cut USA Detergents Inc to neutral from attractive, a PaineWebber source said.</p>
<p>-- After the market closed Wednesday, USA Detergents said it expects its fourth quarter revenues and profits to fall short of analysts' expectations.</p>
</text>
